==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Any strategy that works for the [[Love, Metal Hippoe (Hard)|Love, Metal Hippoe]] should work here, including spamming [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]]. Any [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]] could also be useful, even [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Miss Moneko]]. Kill Teacher Bear with your normal lineup, using cats that outrange him like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]].

==='''Chapter 2 & 3'''===
This stage can be beaten without having to kill the Ursamajor. Just try to [[Critical Hit|Crit]] the Metal Hippoe at the start (any Critical Hitter can work with enough trial and error, even [[Merc (Special Cat)|Merc]] or Miss Moneko) and rush down the base as fast as possible with Giraffe Cat, Dragon Cat, Crazed Bahamut Cat and [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat]] if you have him.

